WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:10.164
In this walkthrough, we are going to use widget row actions. Use the row actions to manage widgets without leaving the editor.

2
00:00:10.164 --> 00:00:12.484
This is useful because it shows the path through the admin interface before you need to do the same task on real content.

3
00:00:12.497 --> 00:00:14.583
Start on a page editor that already contains widgets.

4
00:00:14.583 --> 00:00:17.231
Expand Main Content to reveal the widget row you want to manage.

5
00:00:17.231 --> 00:00:17.978
Find the widget row you want to manage.

6
00:00:17.978 --> 00:00:21.181
Click the copy icon when you want to reuse this widget elsewhere.

7
00:00:21.181 --> 00:00:24.653
Click Active to temporarily hide the widget without deleting its settings.

8
00:00:24.653 --> 00:00:27.477
Click the settings icon when you need to edit the widget configuration.

9
00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:29.817
By the end, you should know where to start, what to click, and what to check before you save or publish your work.
